(text "Speaker spring-contact pads (BOM v1 line 33)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 116.84 115.57 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "048e33ba-e015-5358-a92f-2c7480cb29f5"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: MAX98357A mono class-D amplifier for the internal speaker (0.7 W, BOM line 33).\n2. Absent state: SD_MODE low: shutdown (0.6 µA).\n3. GAIN_SLOT 100 kΩ to VDD: 3 dB, the lowest gain (Rev 11 Table 8), with the Blackbird OS\n   limiter keeping the speaker inside its rating; the gain is a capture choice.\n4. SD_MODE driven at 3.3 V selects the left channel; the 0 Ω position takes the select\n   resistor of Figure 5 if (L+R)/2 is wanted (pinout v1 B8).\n5. VDD from VSYS_LV through link #17, 0.1 Ω (power tree §4.12: 0.3 A peak, 30 mV)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 140.97 0) (size 129.54 20.32) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c81e32ee-ea03-591c-8369-2cc5fe5519ca"))
